        "s1": {
          "type": "policy_section",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "1. Introduction and Acceptance of Terms",
            "content": "<p>Welcome to AnnVaya. These Terms of Service (\u201cTerms\u201d) govern your access to and use of the AnnVaya website at annvaya.com (the \u201cWebsite\u201d), as well as any purchase of products from us. Please read these Terms carefully before using our Website or placing an order.</p><p>By accessing or using our Website, creating an account, or placing an order, you agree to be legally bound by these Terms, our Privacy Policy, our Refund and Replacement Policy, and our Shipping Policy, all of which are incorporated herein by reference. If you do not agree to any of these Terms, please do not use our Website or purchase our products.</p><p>These Terms constitute a legally binding agreement between you and AnnVaya (the business details of which are set out in the information card above) and are governed by the laws of the Republic of India. Any dispute arising under these Terms shall be subject to the jurisdiction of courts in [Your City], India, without prejudice to any statutory rights you may exercise before Consumer Disputes Redressal Commissions.</p>"
          }
        },
        "s2": {
          "type": "policy_section",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "2. About AnnVaya",
            "content": "<p>AnnVaya is a brand that produces and sells <strong>natural dehydrated food products</strong>, including vegetable powders, baby food formulations, and superfood powders, manufactured and sold in India. Our complete business details are displayed in the Business Information card above, as required under the <strong>Consumer Protection (E-Commerce) Rules, 2020</strong>. These details include our brand name, legal entity name, registered address, GSTIN, FSSAI licence number, PAN, and customer contact information.</p><p>AnnVaya operates as an e-commerce entity and is registered under applicable Indian business laws. We hold a valid FSSAI licence for the manufacture and sale of our food products. Our GSTIN is displayed in the Business Information card above, and GST invoices are issued for all orders as required under the <strong>CGST Rules, 2017</strong>.</p><p>For all legal correspondence, please use the contact details in the Business Information card or the Grievance Officer details at the bottom of this page.</p>"
          }
        },
        "s3": {
          "type": "policy_section",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "3. Eligibility",
            "content": "<p>To use our Website and purchase products from AnnVaya, you must meet the following eligibility requirements:</p><ul><li>You must be <strong>18 years of age or older</strong>. Our products are not intended for purchase by minors. If you are under 18, a parent or legal guardian must place the order on your behalf.</li><li>You must be a <strong>resident of India</strong> with a valid delivery address within India. We currently do not ship internationally.</li><li>You must have a valid email address and, where required, a valid mobile phone number registered in India.</li><li>You must have the legal capacity to enter into a binding contract under Indian law (Indian Contract Act, 1872).</li></ul><p>By placing an order or creating an account, you represent and warrant that you meet all of the above eligibility requirements. We reserve the right to refuse orders or close accounts where we have reasonable grounds to believe that the eligibility requirements have not been met, including orders placed on behalf of third parties in a manner that violates these Terms.</p>"
          }
        },
        "s4": {
          "type": "policy_section",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "4. Products and FSSAI Compliance",
            "content": "<p>All AnnVaya products are manufactured under our valid FSSAI licence. We are committed to transparency and compliance with all applicable food safety regulations:</p><ul><li><strong>Product Descriptions:</strong> All product descriptions, ingredient lists, nutritional information, and product claims displayed on our Website are accurate and consistent with the physical product labels. We do not make unsubstantiated health claims. Any nutritional or health-related information provided is based on established scientific literature and is not intended as medical advice.</li><li><strong>Best-Before Dates:</strong> Best-before dates are printed on all product packages as required by FSSAI regulations and the <strong>Legal Metrology (Packaged Commodities) Rules, 2011</strong>. We ensure that products dispatched to consumers have adequate remaining shelf life (see our Shipping Policy for details).</li><li><strong>Vegetarian Status:</strong> All AnnVaya products are <strong>100% vegetarian</strong> unless explicitly labelled otherwise on the product page and packaging. The applicable vegetarian / non-vegetarian logo as required by FSSAI is displayed on all packages.</li><li><strong>Allergen Information:</strong> Known allergens are disclosed on product pages and on packaging. If you have a known food allergy, please review ingredient lists carefully before purchasing. When in doubt, contact us before placing an order.</li><li><strong>No Alcohol:</strong> No AnnVaya product contains alcohol or alcohol-derived ingredients.</li><li><strong>Country of Origin:</strong> All AnnVaya products are manufactured in India.</li><li><strong>MRP Compliance:</strong> Maximum Retail Price (MRP), inclusive of all taxes, is displayed on all product packages as required by the <strong>Legal Metrology (Packaged Commodities) Rules, 2011</strong>. We do not charge consumers more than the MRP displayed on the product packaging.</li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "s5": {
          "type": "policy_section",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "5. Orders and Contract Formation",
            "content": "<p>The following describes how a legally binding contract between you and AnnVaya is formed:</p><ol><li><strong>Offer:</strong> When you complete the checkout process and submit your order (including payment), you are making an <strong>offer to purchase</strong> the products in your cart at the prices displayed.</li><li><strong>Order Confirmation:</strong> After your payment is processed, you will receive an <strong>order confirmation email</strong>. This email acknowledges receipt of your order and payment, but does <strong>not</strong> constitute acceptance of your offer.</li><li><strong>Acceptance and Contract Formation:</strong> The contract between you and AnnVaya is formed only when we <strong>dispatch your order</strong> and send you a dispatch confirmation email with your tracking number. This is when legal acceptance occurs.</li><li><strong>Right to Reject Orders:</strong> We reserve the right to cancel or refuse any order before dispatch for reasons including, but not limited to: payment authorisation failure, product being out of stock, suspected fraudulent activity, or error in price or product description on our Website. If we cancel your order, we will notify you promptly and issue a full refund within 5\u20137 business days.</li></ol><p>This contract formation mechanism is consistent with standard e-commerce practice and does not limit your statutory rights under the Consumer Protection Act, 2019.</p>"
          }
        },
        "s6": {
          "type": "policy_section",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "6. Pricing, GST, and MRP",
            "content": "<p>All prices on the AnnVaya website are displayed in <strong>Indian Rupees (INR)</strong>. We are transparent about all pricing and charges:</p><ul><li><strong>GST Inclusion:</strong> Product prices displayed on our website are <strong>inclusive of applicable Goods and Services Tax (GST)</strong> unless explicitly stated otherwise. The GST amount is shown as a line item at checkout for transparency.</li><li><strong>GST Invoices:</strong> A GST invoice is generated and provided for every order, displaying our GSTIN as required under the <strong>CGST Rules, 2017</strong>. Your invoice will be emailed to you with your order confirmation.</li><li><strong>MRP:</strong> The MRP (Maximum Retail Price) printed on our physical product packages includes all taxes. The online price will not exceed the MRP on the physical product, in compliance with the <strong>Legal Metrology (Packaged Commodities) Rules, 2011</strong>.</li><li><strong>Price Changes:</strong> Product prices may be updated without prior notice. However, once you have placed an order and received an order confirmation, the price of your order is fixed at the amount shown at checkout and will not change.</li><li><strong>No Hidden Charges:</strong> The amount displayed at checkout is the total amount you will be charged. There are no undisclosed fees, surcharges, or processing fees beyond what is shown.</li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "s7": {
          "type": "policy_section",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "7. Payments",
            "content": "<p>All payments on the AnnVaya website are processed by <strong>Razorpay Software Pvt Ltd</strong>, an RBI-authorised Payment Aggregator operating under the <strong>Reserve Bank of India\u2019s Guidelines on Regulation of Payment Aggregators and Payment Gateways</strong>.</p><p><strong>Accepted Payment Methods:</strong></p><ul><li>Credit Cards (Visa, Mastercard, RuPay, Amex)</li><li>Debit Cards (Visa, Mastercard, RuPay)</li><li>UPI (Google Pay, PhonePe, Paytm, BHIM, and others)</li><li>Net Banking (major Indian banks)</li><li>Digital Wallets (as supported by Razorpay)</li><li>EMI (credit card and debit card EMI, as available)</li><li>Cash on Delivery (COD) \u2014 subject to pincode and order value limits as described in our Shipping Policy</li></ul><p><strong>Data Security:</strong> We do not store, access, or process your card numbers, CVV codes, UPI PINs, bank account credentials, or any other payment credentials. All payment data is handled exclusively by Razorpay on its PCI-DSS certified infrastructure.</p><p><strong>Razorpay Terms:</strong> By making a payment on our website, you also agree to Razorpay\u2019s Terms of Service and Privacy Policy, available at <a href=\"https://razorpay.com/terms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">razorpay.com/terms</a> and <a href=\"https://razorpay.com/privacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">razorpay.com/privacy</a>.</p><p><strong>Currency:</strong> All payments must be made in Indian Rupees (INR). We do not accept foreign currency payments.</p>"
          }
        },
        "s8": {
          "type": "policy_section",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "8. Cancellations",
            "content": "<p>Our cancellation terms are designed to be fair and comply with the <strong>Consumer Protection (E-Commerce) Rules, 2020</strong>:</p><p><strong>Cancellation by You (Before Dispatch):</strong><br>You may cancel your order within <strong>12 hours</strong> of placing it by emailing <a href=\"mailto:hello@annvaya.com\">hello@annvaya.com</a> with your order number. A full refund will be issued to your original payment method. After 12 hours, your order may already be in processing and cancellation may not be possible.</p><p><strong>Cancellation After Dispatch:</strong><br>Orders cannot be cancelled after dispatch. Please refer to our Refund and Replacement Policy for your options after receiving the product.</p><p><strong>No Cancellation Fees:</strong><br>We do not charge any cancellation fees to consumers on pre-paid orders cancelled before dispatch. This is in compliance with <strong>Consumer Protection (E-Commerce) Rules, 2020, Section 6(3)</strong>.</p><p><strong>Cancellation by AnnVaya:</strong><br>We reserve the right to cancel orders in cases of fraud, failed payment authorisation, product unavailability, breach of these Terms, or force majeure. In such cases, you will be notified and a full refund will be issued within 5\u20137 business days. We will not charge you any fee if we cancel your order.</p>"
          }
        },
