          "type": "policy_section",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "9. Prohibited Uses",
            "content": "<p>By using the AnnVaya website, you agree not to engage in any of the following prohibited activities:</p><ul><li><strong>Unlawful use:</strong> Using the Website for any purpose that is illegal under Indian law, including fraud, money laundering, or any activity that violates the Information Technology Act, 2000.</li><li><strong>Unauthorised access:</strong> Attempting to gain unauthorised access to any part of our website, servers, databases, or connected systems.</li><li><strong>Automated scraping:</strong> Using bots, scrapers, crawlers, or other automated tools to access, extract, or copy content from our Website without our written permission.</li><li><strong>Intellectual property infringement:</strong> Reproducing, distributing, publicly displaying, or creating derivative works from any content on our Website without prior written permission.</li><li><strong>False information:</strong> Providing false, misleading, or fraudulent information in any form, including during account registration, order placement, or return/refund requests.</li><li><strong>Policy abuse:</strong> Misusing our refund, return, or replacement policy, including making fraudulent claims or repeatedly placing and cancelling orders to manipulate our systems.</li><li><strong>Spam or harassment:</strong> Using our contact channels to send unsolicited communications, spam, or harass our team or other users.</li></ul><p>Violation of these prohibited use terms may result in immediate account suspension, cancellation of pending orders, and legal action under applicable Indian law, including the IT Act, 2000, the IPC, and the Consumer Protection Act, 2019.</p>"
          }
        },
