          "type": "policy_section",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "10. Intellectual Property",
            "content": "<p>All content on the AnnVaya website, including but not limited to: the AnnVaya brand name and logo, product names, product images and photography, written descriptions, nutritional information and content, website design and layout, graphics, and marketing materials, is owned by or licenced to AnnVaya and is protected under Indian and international intellectual property laws, including the <strong>Trade Marks Act, 1999</strong>, the <strong>Copyright Act, 1957</strong>, and applicable design laws.</p><p><strong>Permitted Use:</strong> You may view, download, and print content from our Website solely for your personal, non-commercial use in connection with evaluating or purchasing our products.</p><p><strong>Prohibited Use:</strong> You may not, without our prior written permission:</p><ul><li>Reproduce, republish, distribute, or create derivative works from any Website content</li><li>Use AnnVaya\u2019s name, logo, or product images for commercial purposes</li><li>Use any AnnVaya trademark or trade dress in a manner that could cause confusion or that falsely suggests affiliation with or endorsement by AnnVaya</li><li>Frame or mirror any part of our Website on any other website without written permission</li></ul><p>Requests for licensing or permission to use our intellectual property should be directed to <a href=\"mailto:hello@annvaya.com\">hello@annvaya.com</a>.</p>"
