            "content": "<p>The AnnVaya website and its operations rely on several third-party platforms and services. We disclose these for transparency:</p><ul><li><strong>Shopify Inc.:</strong> Our website is hosted and operated on Shopify\u2019s e-commerce platform. Shopify processes certain order and customer data on our behalf. Shopify\u2019s Terms of Service are available at <a href=\"https://www.shopify.com/legal/terms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">shopify.com/legal/terms</a>.</li><li><strong>Razorpay Software Pvt Ltd:</strong> All payment processing is handled by Razorpay, an RBI-authorised Payment Aggregator. Razorpay\u2019s terms are available at <a href=\"https://razorpay.com/terms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">razorpay.com/terms</a>.</li><li><strong>Logistics and Courier Partners:</strong> Delivery is handled by third-party courier companies. These partners are bound by their own terms, but are contractually required by us to handle your data and your order responsibly.</li><li><strong>Google Analytics and Meta Pixel:</strong> Analytics and advertising measurement tools operated by Google LLC and Meta Platforms, Inc. respectively. Please see our Privacy Policy for more details.</li></ul><p>AnnVaya is not responsible for the terms, privacy practices, conduct, or reliability of these third-party platforms and services. Any dispute with these third parties must be resolved directly with them under their respective terms. We recommend reviewing their policies before transacting.</p>"
