        "s12": {
          "type": "policy_section",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "12. Limitation of Liability",
            "content": "<p>To the maximum extent permitted by applicable Indian law, AnnVaya\u2019s total liability to you for any claim arising from or related to your use of our Website or your purchase of our products shall be limited to the <strong>purchase price of the specific order giving rise to the claim</strong>.</p><p>We shall not be liable for any:</p><ul><li>Indirect, incidental, consequential, or punitive damages</li><li>Loss of profits, revenue, data, or business opportunities</li><li>Damages arising from third-party actions (including courier delays or payment gateway issues)</li><li>Damages arising from force majeure events beyond our reasonable control</li></ul><p><strong>IMPORTANT \u2014 Consumer Rights Preserved:</strong> This limitation of liability does <strong>not</strong> restrict, limit, or waive any rights you are entitled to as a consumer under the <strong>Consumer Protection Act, 2019</strong>. You retain all statutory consumer rights, including the right to approach District Consumer Disputes Redressal Commissions, State Commissions, and the National Commission. No clause in these Terms shall be construed as an unfair contract term under the Consumer Protection Act, 2019.</p>"
