        "s13": {
          "type": "policy_section",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "13. Disclaimer of Warranties",
            "content": "<p>To the extent permitted by applicable law, AnnVaya provides its products and Website on an \u201cas is\u201d and \u201cas available\u201d basis. We make the following specific disclaimers:</p><ul><li><strong>No Health Outcome Warranty:</strong> We do not warrant or guarantee specific health outcomes, therapeutic benefits, or medical results from consuming our products. Our products are foods, not medicines. Nutritional information and descriptions are provided for informational purposes only and should not be construed as medical advice. Consult a qualified healthcare professional before making significant dietary changes.</li><li><strong>Nutritional Values:</strong> Nutritional information displayed on product pages and packaging is based on average values from standardised testing and may vary slightly from batch to batch due to the natural variation in raw ingredients. This is normal and does not constitute a defect.</li><li><strong>Product Images:</strong> Product images on our Website are representative and for illustrative purposes. Actual product colour may vary slightly from images due to natural ingredient colour variation, photography lighting, and screen display settings. This is not a grounds for return.</li><li><strong>Website Availability:</strong> We do not warrant that our Website will be available at all times, error-free, or uninterrupted. We may perform maintenance, updates, or take the site offline for operational reasons.</li></ul><p>These disclaimers do not affect your statutory rights regarding defective or misdescribed products under the Consumer Protection Act, 2019.</p>"
