            "content": "<p>We may update or amend these Terms of Service from time to time to reflect changes in our business practices, services, or applicable law. When we make changes, we will update the \u201cLast Updated\u201d date displayed at the top of this page.</p><p><strong>Notice for Material Changes:</strong> For any material changes to these Terms \u2014 changes that significantly affect your rights or obligations \u2014 we will provide you with at least <strong>30 days\u2019 advance written notice</strong> via email to your registered email address, as required under the <strong>IT (Intermediary Guidelines and Digital Media Ethics Code) Rules, 2021</strong>.</p><p><strong>Acceptance:</strong> Your continued use of our Website or placement of orders after the effective date of any updated Terms constitutes your acceptance of the revised Terms. If you do not agree with any changes, you may discontinue use of our Website and close your account before the effective date of the changes.</p><p>We encourage you to periodically review these Terms to remain informed of any updates. The current version of these Terms will always be available at annvaya.com/policies/terms-of-service.</p>"
